  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The average power per unit area that is incident perpendicular to the direction of propagation is called the intensity, i.e.,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#960;r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br />Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
